[
  {
    "id": "314ff71060be13cd8a9b",
    "source": "Damage and healing you apply by hand (apply_damage, heal without a spell) are the server's to roll: send dice (\"2d6\") and it rolls them, or send a total it rolled this turn (request_roll kind damage); a number of your own is refused. A condition that binds a creature (blinded, charmed, deafened, frightened, grappled, incapacitated, paralyzed, petrified, poisoned, prone, restrained, stunned, unconscious) lands through set_condition only with saveAbility and saveDc: the server rolls the save first and lays it on a failure. A binding condition a save, a duration or a spell keeps is never cleared by hand; it ends by itself or through the cure cast for it.",
    "sourceHash": "314ff71060be13cd8a9b945eaabc7e65e54940baccbfe27427d93beb30f92931",
